{"id":"chatcmpl-d3ff2e55-b3c4-4dc7-94cd-27712b466381","object":"chat.completion","created":1795248732,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task succeeds by decomposing a visual medical question into a targeted anatomical query and then corroborating the answer across two independent vision-language models. The key insight is that lateral-view anatomy requires explicit reasoning about which hemidiaphragm is which, so the strategy queries for relative position and laterality rather than asking directly for the answer. Agreement between independent tools serves as the confidence signal before committing.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a visual question hinges on spatial/anatomical relationships, ask the model to describe relative positions first, then infer the labeled finding.\",\n    \"Use two or more independent visual reasoning tools and treat cross-model agreement as the confidence threshold for the final answer.\",\n    \"Encode view-specific context (e.g., lateral vs. frontal) in the query so the model reasons with the correct anatomical conventions.\",\n    \"Convert the multiple-choice decision into an open-ended descriptive query, then map the description back to the option set.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"State the imaging view and laterality explicitly in the prompt; ask for relative anatomical descriptions before asking for the diagnosis.\",\n    \"Multi-tool corroboration\": \"Route the same question to independent models with slightly different phrasing; require convergent answers before finalizing.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice from visual evidence\": \"Ask for a free-form description of the key finding, then match it to the closest option rather than prompting with the options directly.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the imaging view (lateral/frontal) and laterality labels are included in every tool query.\",\n    \"Verify that at least two independent tools agree on the specific finding before selecting the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":460,"total_tokens":816,"completion_tokens":356,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":460},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":356}}}